# systemd 服務範本：把"中繼站"當成背景服務跑在 VPS／樹莓派（Linux）上，開機自動啟動、掛掉自動重開
# systemd unit template: runs the relay as a background service on a VPS (Linux) with a public IP;
# starts at boot and restarts itself if it crashes.
#
# 使用前請建立專用帳號並依實際情況調整 User 與路徑，然後 / Before use, create a dedicated account and adjust User and the paths, then:
#   sudo cp deploy/discord-musicbot-relay.service /etc/systemd/system/
#   sudo systemctl daemon-reload && sudo systemctl enable --now discord-musicbot-relay
# 看日誌 / view the log:   journalctl -u discord-musicbot-relay -f
# 檢查沙盒強度 / check the sandbox score:   systemd-analyze security discord-musicbot-relay
[Unit]
Description=Discord Music Bot - Relay (dashboard node)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
User=musicbot
WorkingDirectory=/opt/discord-musicbot
# RELAY_KEY 等設定放在 WorkingDirectory 底下的 .env（chmod 600，只有 musicbot 能讀）
# RELAY_KEY is read from the .env under WorkingDirectory (chmod 600, readable by the musicbot user only).
ExecStart=/opt/discord-musicbot/.venv/bin/python -X utf8 -m musicbot.relay
Restart=always
RestartSec=5

# ---- 資源上限：中繼站只轉送訊息，吃得很少；萬一被灌也不會拖垮整台機器 ----
# ---- Resource limits: the relay only forwards messages; even under attack it can't drag down the whole host ----
MemoryMax=200M
TasksMax=64
LimitNOFILE=4096
Nice=5

# ---- 沙盒：這個程式只需要"收發網路"與"寫自己的資料夾"，其餘全部拿掉 ----
# ---- Sandbox: the program only needs network access and write access to its own folder; everything else is taken away ----
NoNewPrivileges=true
CapabilityBoundingSet=
AmbientCapabilities=
UMask=0077
PrivateTmp=true
PrivateDevices=true
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=true
ReadWritePaths=/opt/discord-musicbot
ProtectProc=invisible
ProcSubset=pid
ProtectKernelTunables=true
ProtectKernelModules=true
ProtectKernelLogs=true
ProtectControlGroups=true
ProtectClock=true
ProtectHostname=true
RestrictAddressFamilies=AF_INET AF_INET6
RestrictNamespaces=true
RestrictRealtime=true
RestrictSUIDSGID=true
LockPersonality=true
MemoryDenyWriteExecute=true
SystemCallArchitectures=native
SystemCallFilter=@system-service
SystemCallFilter=~@privileged @resources

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
